hyper-util: dial on WASI without socket2 or TcpSocket (neither exists there).
connect() opens the socket with wasix-net (WASIX sock_connect, slicc's
kernel) and hands it to tokio::net::TcpStream::from_std. socket2 becomes
a non-WASI dependency; keepalive and bind options do not apply on WASI.

